    "text": "$\\mathrm{XeF}_4$ has zero dipole moment. It has square planar structure due to which the bond moments of $\\mathrm{Xe}-\\mathrm{F}$ cancel each other.\n<img src=\"assets\\st0263_b4335d88b10b.png\"><br>"
